---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="월코 사역 — Word of Life Korea"
  description="캠프, 제주월비, 청소년 사역, SYME로 이어지는 Word of Life Korea의 다음 세대 사역을 한눈에 살펴보세요."
  activeNav="ministry"
>
  <main class="ministry-hub">
    <section class="mh-hero">
      <div class="mh-orbit mh-orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mh-orbit mh-orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mh-shell mh-hero-inner">
        <div class="mh-hero-copy">
          <p class="mh-eyebrow">OUR MINISTRIES</p>
          <h1>
            <span class="wl-ko">다음 세대를 세우는<br><em>네 개의 사역</em></span>
            <span class="wl-en">Four Ministries,<br><em>One Gospel</em></span>
          </h1>
          <p class="mh-hero-desc">
            <span class="wl-ko">캠프의 특별한 만남부터 일상의 제자훈련과 깊이 있는 성경교육까지, 월코는 복음으로 다음 세대의 삶을 연결합니다.</span>
            <span class="wl-en">From life-changing camps to everyday discipleship and in-depth Bible training, WOLKO connects the next generation with the Gospel.</span>
          </p>
          <a class="mh-hero-cta" href="#ministry-overview">
            <span class="wl-ko">사역 한눈에 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore the Ministries</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 4v11m0 0 4-4m-4 4-4-4"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mh-mosaic" aria-label="월코 주요 사역">
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-camp" href="#camp-ministry">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/WOLKO_Hero.JPG" alt="월코 캠프 현장" loading="eager">
            <span><small>01</small><strong class="wl-ko">캠프</strong><strong class="wl-en">Camp</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-wolbi" href="#wolbi-ministry">
            <img src="/images/wolbi-jeju/hero-campus-spring-2026.jpeg" alt="제주월비 학생들" loading="eager">
            <span><small>02</small><strong class="wl-ko">제주월비</strong><strong class="wl-en">Jeju WOLBI</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-youth" href="#youth-ministry">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Youth_Ministry/CT.png" alt="월코 청소년 사역" loading="lazy">
            <span><small>03</small><strong class="wl-ko">청소년 사역</strong><strong class="wl-en">Youth</strong></span>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-mosaic-item mh-mosaic-syme" href="#syme-ministry">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/Jeju%201.jpg" alt="SYME 제자훈련" loading="lazy">
            <span><small>04</small><strong>SYME</strong></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-intro" id="ministry-overview">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-intro-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="mh-section-kicker"><span class="wl-ko">월코의 사역</span><span class="wl-en">WOLKO MINISTRIES</span></p>
          <h2><span class="wl-ko">각기 다른 현장,<br>하나의 분명한 목적</span><span class="wl-en">Different Settings,<br>One Clear Purpose</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="mh-intro-copy">
          <span class="wl-ko">모든 사역은 청소년과 청년이 복음을 듣고, 말씀 안에서 성장하며, 지역 교회와 세상 속에서 그리스도의 제자로 살아가도록 돕는 한 가지 목적을 향합니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Every ministry shares one purpose: helping young people hear the Gospel, grow in God's Word, and live as disciples of Christ in their churches and communities.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-programs" aria-label="월코 사역 목록">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-program-grid">
        <article class="mh-card" id="camp-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/camp" aria-label="캠프 사역 자세히 보기">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/Camp_Group.jpg" alt="캠프 참가자 단체 사진" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">01</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">CAMP MINISTRY</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">캠프 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Camp Ministry</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-desc">
              <span class="wl-ko">일상을 잠시 벗어나 복음을 분명히 듣고, 공동체 안에서 믿음을 삶으로 경험하는 월코의 핵심 사역입니다.</span>
              <span class="wl-en">WOLKO's signature ministry where young people step away from daily routines, hear the Gospel clearly, and experience faith in community.</span>
            </p>
            <ul class="mh-tags" aria-label="캠프 사역 주요 내용">
              <li><span class="wl-ko">영어캠프</span><span class="wl-en">English Camp</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">제주캠프</span><span class="wl-en">Jeju Camp</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">연합캠프</span><span class="wl-en">Union Camp</span></li>
            </ul>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/camp">
              <span class="wl-ko">캠프 사역 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore Camp Ministry</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="wolbi-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/wolbi-jeju" aria-label="제주월비 자세히 보기">
            <img src="/images/wolbi-jeju/hero-campus-spring-2026.jpeg" alt="제주월비 공동체" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">02</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">WORD OF LIFE BIBLE INSTITUTE</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">제주월비</span><span class="wl-en">WOLBI Jeju</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-desc">
              <span class="wl-ko">제주 캠퍼스에서 말씀을 깊이 배우고 공동체 생활과 사역을 함께 경험하는 집중 성경학교 과정입니다.</span>
              <span class="wl-en">An immersive Bible Institute experience on Jeju where students study Scripture deeply and grow through community, ministry, and mission.</span>
            </p>
            <ul class="mh-tags" aria-label="제주월비 주요 내용">
              <li><span class="wl-ko">11개월 과정</span><span class="wl-en">11 Months</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">공동체 생활</span><span class="wl-en">Community Life</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">선교 경험</span><span class="wl-en">Missions</span></li>
            </ul>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/wolbi-jeju">
              <span class="wl-ko">제주월비 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore WOLBI Jeju</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="youth-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/youth" aria-label="청소년 사역 자세히 보기">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Youth_Ministry/Banner%202.png" alt="청소년 사역 현장" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">03</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">YOUTH MINISTRY</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">청소년 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Youth Ministry</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-desc">
              <span class="wl-ko">지역 교회와 함께 리더를 세우고, 학생들의 일상과 관계 속에 복음이 이어지도록 돕는 지속적인 사역입니다.</span>
              <span class="wl-en">An ongoing ministry that equips local church leaders and helps students carry the Gospel into their everyday lives and relationships.</span>
            </p>
            <ul class="mh-tags" aria-label="청소년 사역 주요 내용">
              <li><span class="wl-ko">리더 훈련</span><span class="wl-en">Leader Training</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">학생 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Student Ministry</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">교회 연결</span><span class="wl-en">Church Connection</span></li>
            </ul>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/youth">
              <span class="wl-ko">청소년 사역 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore Youth Ministry</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="mh-card" id="syme-ministry">
          <a class="mh-card-media" href="/jr-syme" aria-label="SYME 제자훈련 자세히 보기">
            <img src="https://wolko.synology.me/Web_Contents/Photos/Camp_Ministry/Jeju%201.jpg" alt="SYME 제자훈련 참가 학생들" loading="lazy">
            <span class="mh-card-number">04</span>
          </a>
          <div class="mh-card-body">
            <p class="mh-card-label">JR. SYME DISCIPLESHIP</p>
            <h3><span class="wl-ko">SYME 제자훈련</span><span class="wl-en">SYME Discipleship</span></h3>
            <p class="mh-card-desc">
              <span class="wl-ko">중·고등학생이 영어 환경에서 말씀과 삶을 함께 훈련하며 믿음의 기초를 세우는 방학 집중 제자훈련입니다.</span>
              <span class="wl-en">An intensive vacation discipleship program where middle and high school students build a foundation of faith through English, Scripture, and shared life.</span>
            </p>
            <ul class="mh-tags" aria-label="SYME 주요 내용">
              <li><span class="wl-ko">중·고등학생</span><span class="wl-en">Grades 7-12</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">3주 집중과정</span><span class="wl-en">3 Weeks</span></li>
              <li><span class="wl-ko">영어 제자훈련</span><span class="wl-en">English Discipleship</span></li>
            </ul>
            <a class="mh-card-link" href="/jr-syme">
              <span class="wl-ko">SYME 자세히 보기</span><span class="wl-en">Explore SYME</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mh-closing">
      <div class="mh-shell mh-closing-card">
        <div>
          <p class="mh-section-kicker"><span class="wl-ko">함께 알아보기</span><span class="wl-en">START A CONVERSATION</span></p>
          <h2><span class="wl-ko">어떤 사역이 가장 잘 맞을지<br>함께 이야기해 보세요.</span><span class="wl-en">Let's find the right ministry<br>for you or your church.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mh-closing-actions">
          <a class="mh-btn mh-btn-primary" href="/contact">
            <span class="wl-ko">문의하기</span><span class="wl-en">Contact Us</span>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10h11m0 0-4-4m4 4-4 4"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="mh-btn mh-btn-secondary" href="/about">
            <span class="wl-ko">월코 소개</span><span class="wl-en">About WOLKO</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .ministry-hub {
      --mh-deep: #003f55;
      --mh-ink: #132c37;
      --mh-mid: #007ea1;
      --mh-sky: #73d1f5;
      --mh-muted: #607681;
      --mh-line: #dbe7eb;
      --mh-soft: #f2f7f9;
      --mh-white: #fff;
      color: var(--mh-ink);
      background: var(--mh-white);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .mh-shell { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }

    .mh-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 690px;
      padding: 130px 0 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 16%, rgba(115,209,245,.14), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #002f41 0%, #004f68 58%, #006a86 100%);
    }
    .mh-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      opacity: .18;
      background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 64px 64px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #000, transparent 78%);
    }
    .mh-orbit { position: absolute; border: 1px solid rgba(115,209,245,.16); border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none; }
    .mh-orbit-one { width: 660px; height: 660px; left: -330px; bottom: -400px; }
    .mh-orbit-two { width: 430px; height: 430px; left: -215px; bottom: -285px; }
    .mh-hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: .88fr 1.12fr; align-items: center; gap: 72px; }
    .mh-eyebrow, .mh-section-kicker { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .16em; color: var(--mh-sky); }
    .mh-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .mh-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 28px; height: 2px; background: #d82939; }
    .mh-hero h1 { max-width: 560px; color: #fff; font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: clamp(44px, 5.2vw, 68px); line-height: 1.16; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .mh-hero h1 em { color: #94e1fb; font-style: normal; }
    .mh-hero-desc { max-width: 530px; margin-top: 24px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.73); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .mh-hero-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 50px; margin-top: 34px; padding: 0 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); border-radius: 10px; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; background: rgba(255,255,255,.09); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); transition: background .22s, transform .22s, border-color .22s; }
    .mh-hero-cta svg, .mh-card-link svg, .mh-btn svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
    .mh-hero-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: rgba(255,255,255,.16); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.45); }

    .mh-mosaic { height: 476px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; transform: rotate(1deg); }
    .mh-mosaic-item { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17); box-shadow: 0 24px 55px rgba(0,20,30,.24); text-decoration: none; }
    .mh-mosaic-item::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 48%, rgba(0,27,38,.84)); }
    .mh-mosaic-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1), filter .3s; }
    .mh-mosaic-item > span { position: absolute; z-index: 2; left: 18px; right: 18px; bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; color: #fff; }
    .mh-mosaic-item small { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--mh-sky); }
    .mh-mosaic-item strong { font-size: 15px; }
    .mh-mosaic-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.055); filter: saturate(1.08); }
    .mh-mosaic-camp img { object-position: 47% center; }
    .mh-mosaic-wolbi img { object-position: center 48%; }
    .mh-mosaic-youth img { object-position: center 38%; }
    .mh-mosaic-syme img { object-position: center 44%; }

    .mh-intro { padding: 96px 0 62px; }
    .mh-intro-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: end; gap: 100px; }
    .mh-section-kicker { margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--mh-mid); }
    .mh-intro h2, .mh-closing h2 { font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .mh-intro-copy { color: var(--mh-muted); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.9; }

    .mh-programs { padding: 18px 0 112px; }
    .mh-program-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
    .mh-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--mh-line); border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(18,56,70,.055); transition: transform .26s, box-shadow .26s, border-color .26s; scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
    .mh-card:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: rgba(0,126,161,.28); box-shadow: 0 24px 58px rgba(18,56,70,.12); }
    .mh-card-media { position: relative; display: block; height: 264px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--mh-deep); }
    .mh-card-media::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 56%, rgba(0,38,51,.45)); }
    .mh-card-media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1); }
    .mh-card:hover .mh-card-media img { transform: scale(1.035); }
    .mh-card:nth-child(2) .mh-card-media img { object-position: center 45%; }
    .mh-card:nth-child(3) .mh-card-media img { object-position: center 42%; }
    .mh-card-number { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 18px; bottom: 16px; width: 42px; height: 42px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.34); border-radius: 50%; color: #fff; background: rgba(0,48,65,.55); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .mh-card-body { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 34px 36px 32px; }
    .mh-card-label { margin-bottom: 11px; color: var(--mh-mid); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .13em; }
    .mh-card h3 { font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
    .mh-card-desc { margin-top: 16px; color: var(--mh-muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; }
    .mh-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 24px; list-style: none; }
    .mh-tags li { padding: 8px 11px; border-radius: 999px; color: #42616d; background: var(--mh-soft); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; }
    .mh-card-link { width: fit-content; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin-top: 28px; color: var(--mh-deep); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }
    .mh-card-link svg { transition: transform .2s; }
    .mh-card-link:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }

    .mh-closing { padding: 0 0 112px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0, var(--mh-soft) 100%); }
    .mh-closing-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 52px; padding: 52px 58px; border-radius: 24px; color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(125deg, #003f55, #005f7b); box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,63,85,.2); }
    .mh-closing .mh-section-kicker { color: var(--mh-sky); }
    .mh-closing h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 42px); }
    .mh-closing-actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
    .mh-btn { min-height: 48px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; padding: 0 19px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .2s, background .2s; }
    .mh-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .mh-btn-primary { color: var(--mh-deep); background: #fff; }
    .mh-btn-secondary { color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26); background: rgba(255,255,255,.07); }

    @media (max-width: 980px) {
      .mh-hero { min-height: auto; padding: 130px 0 78px; }
      .mh-hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 50px; }
      .mh-hero-copy { max-width: 700px; }
      .mh-mosaic { height: 410px; transform: none; }
      .mh-intro-inner { gap: 50px; }
      .mh-closing-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .mh-closing-actions { justify-content: flex-start; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 740px) {
      .mh-shell { width: min(100% - 36px, 1180px); }
      .mh-hero { padding: 116px 0 54px; }
      .mh-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 12vw, 52px); }
      .mh-hero-desc { font-size: 15px; }
      .mh-mosaic { height: 370px; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; }
      .mh-mosaic-item { border-radius: 11px; }
